# Proof 321 — digit-9 depth-8 combinators: 8NIP 8ROT 8RROT
HOLD_FLASH 1
SCIENCE LOAD

# 8NIP — keep ends
CLEARSTACK
PUSH 1
PUSH 2
PUSH 3
PUSH 4
PUSH 5
PUSH 6
PUSH 7
PUSH 8
8NIP
ASSERT SP == 2
POP h
POP a
ASSERT a == 1
ASSERT h == 8

